OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright conditions continue through the
OL,7,Fevening. The night will stay mostly
OL,8,Fdry with clear periods as the fresh
OL,9,Fwesterly wind gradually eases down.
OL,10,FSmall chance of the odd light spot of
OL,11,Frain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells for much of the day. Sunshine
OL,15,Fturning hazier in the afternoon as
OL,16,Fcloud spreads east. Small chance of
OL,17,Fthe odd light spot of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
