OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of heavy rain Monday.
OL,7,FBright spells and showery rain on
OL,8,FTuesday. Drier for a time on
OL,9,FWednesday, before further rain later.
